<title>MONACO: SQUASH-FITZ-GERALD WINS MONTE CARLO WOMEN'S CLASSIC.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-FITZ-GERALD WINS MONTE CARLO WOMEN'S CLASSIC.</headline>
<dateline>MONACO 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final of the Monte Carlo women's squash classic on Saturday:</p>
<p>Sarah Fitz-Gerald (Australia) beat Cassie Jackman (England) 9-4 9-2 4-9 9-6.</p>
</text>
